## Omarchy

The theme palettes under `home/.config/theme/themes/` (all except
`retro-82`, `kanagawa-wave` and `catppuccin-mocha`) are ported from the
`themes/<name>/colors.toml` files in Omarchy,
https://github.com/omacom/omarchy, by `theme-port`. Theme wallpapers are not
redistributed in this repository; `theme-bg-fetch` downloads them from the
Omarchy repository onto your machine at install time.

